2 
3 Loads tradable asset closes through visible_through, computes factor values,
4 daily cross-sectional rank IC vs forward returns, ICIR, turnover, coverage,
5 decay, and max abs correlation vs existing library factors.
6 
7 Methodology mirrors library factors: daily Spearman rank IC across the
8 15-asset cross-section (>=8 valid instruments per date), forward-return
9 horizon 10d for admission, decay table over horizons 1/2/3/5/10/20.
10 """
11 import json
